#: agents/apps.py:11
msgid "Agents"
msgstr "Agents"

#: agents/replies.py:27
msgid ""
"This service only answers questions about Islam. Please ask a question about "
"Islam."
msgstr ""
"Ce service répond uniquement aux questions sur l’islam. Veuillez poser une "
"question sur l’islam."

#: agents/replies.py:29
msgid ""
"Your question needs a specialist. It has been referred to a center of "
"specialists, who will answer you."
msgstr ""
"Votre question nécessite un spécialiste. Elle a été transmise à un centre de "
"spécialistes, qui vous répondra."

#: agents/replies.py:31
msgid ""
"This question asks for a ruling on your personal situation. Musnid does not "
"issue personal rulings: only a qualified specialist can, knowing your "
"circumstances. You can send your question to a center of specialists."
msgstr ""
"Cette question demande un avis sur votre situation personnelle. Musnid ne "
"donne pas d’avis personnels : seul un spécialiste qualifié le peut, en "
"connaissant votre situation. Vous pouvez envoyer votre question à un centre "
"de spécialistes."

#: agents/replies.py:34
msgid ""
"Our verified sources do not cover this question, so Musnid will not answer "
"it from its own knowledge. You can send your question to a center of "
"specialists."
msgstr ""
"Nos sources vérifiées ne couvrent pas cette question ; Musnid n’y répondra "
"donc pas de lui-même. Vous pouvez envoyer votre question à un centre de "
"spécialistes."

#: agents/replies.py:37
msgid ""
"We could not find an answer to this question in our sources. Please rephrase "
"it or ask a center of specialists."
msgstr ""
"Nous n’avons pas trouvé de réponse à cette question dans nos sources. "
"Veuillez la reformuler ou interroger un centre de spécialistes."

#: agents/replies.py:39
msgid "Note: our sources answer this question only in part."
msgstr "Remarque : nos sources ne répondent qu’en partie à cette question."

#: agents/replies.py:40
msgid ""
"This matter involves scholarly disagreement; consult a specialist for your "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"Cette question fait l’objet de divergences entre savants ; consultez un "
"spécialiste pour votre situation."

#: agents/replies.py:42
msgid ""
"The service has reached its limit of questions for today. Please try again "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"Le service a atteint sa limite de questions pour aujourd’hui. Veuillez "
"réessayer demain."

#: api/apps.py:11
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: api/exceptions.py:43
msgid "The service cannot take questions right now. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Le service ne peut pas recevoir de questions pour le moment. Veuillez "
"réessayer plus tard."

#: api/exceptions.py:51
msgid "Telegram cannot be reached right now. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "Telegram est injoignable pour le moment. Réessayez dans un instant."

#: api/permissions.py:19
